WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.570 --> 01:46.740
=Episode 21=

02:02.360 --> 02:03.960
Our honored guest has arrived.

02:47.280 --> 02:48.300
My sincere welcome.

02:53.880 --> 02:55.960
I have been waiting for your arrival,
Commander Ying.

02:57.079 --> 03:00.280
You can resonate with Rehai.

03:01.160 --> 03:03.400
I bet you're one of the guardians
of the Nine Springs.

03:03.920 --> 03:06.000
Which hole of spring are you guarding?

03:13.840 --> 03:14.860
Mist Soul.

03:19.720 --> 03:21.880
I met Physician Bian some time ago

03:21.880 --> 03:24.200
and I had many questions to ask.

03:25.280 --> 03:26.560
You're here for...

03:29.640 --> 03:32.079
I came for Rehai.

03:34.800 --> 03:36.720
Commander Ying, you're really direct.

03:37.480 --> 03:40.200
I heard the Zhengwu Alliance
wiped out the Qiyuan Sect.

03:40.720 --> 03:45.280
The disciples mistook Miss Yue
for Lord Ming. Not only that.

03:46.360 --> 03:49.640
She also turned into Kun on the spot.

03:54.520 --> 03:56.160
You're very well-informed, Mr. Luo.

03:57.360 --> 04:00.080
It seems that Luo Zhaoyan
has told you about it.

04:00.760 --> 04:04.080
The Qiyuan Sect
was giving out Qiyuan Orbs

04:04.840 --> 04:06.400
for Lord Ming to absorb energy.

04:07.760 --> 04:09.960
Now you destroyed the Qiyuan Sect.

04:09.960 --> 04:13.880
Is it because you've gathered
enough Qiyuan Orbs?

04:17.800 --> 04:20.440
You found the answer. Why bother asking?

04:21.000 --> 04:22.029
Not so.

04:24.400 --> 04:27.640
There are many things
I haven't figured out.

04:28.400 --> 04:32.080
Like the story between the Hengdao Sect
and the Sea of Clear Skies.

04:32.680 --> 04:35.680
And why are you interested in Rehai

04:35.680 --> 04:37.680
as the guardian of Mist Soul?

04:42.280 --> 04:44.400
To achieve better cooperation,

04:45.120 --> 04:47.960
please answer my questions.

05:00.480 --> 05:03.720
I hope we can work well together.

05:10.440 --> 05:14.040
This is the key ring of Rehai?

05:17.200 --> 05:18.760
This key ring of Rehai

05:19.880 --> 05:22.080
is an important item against Zhu Yu.

05:24.200 --> 05:26.400
It's made from the dragon bone of Guixu.

05:27.600 --> 05:32.920
Shennong forged
the key ring with dragon bone.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.860
I duplicated it

05:35.760 --> 05:37.360
to confuse Zhu Yu.

05:39.200 --> 05:44.040
Interesting. The key ring
of Rehai can be forged.

05:45.400 --> 05:49.080
Cang Feng, keep it.

05:53.040 --> 05:56.920
Cang Feng, you're also
a guardian of Rehai now.

05:59.480 --> 06:00.500
I appreciate that.

06:05.600 --> 06:09.760
Next time we meet,
we'll discuss how to deal with Zhu Yu.

06:11.400 --> 06:14.240
I've agreed
to side with you against Zhu Yu.

06:14.920 --> 06:16.000
In exchange,

06:16.880 --> 06:20.560
will you show me
some sincerity, Commander Ying?

06:23.920 --> 06:27.080
I wonder if the way to remove
the Bloodbinding can show my sincerity.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.160
Of course, it can.

06:34.640 --> 06:37.680
Bloodbinding the hole of spring
defies the will of heaven.

06:37.680 --> 06:41.840
It can only be removed
with the help of a kin's blood.

06:43.040 --> 06:46.560
The closer the kin,
the more likely it's going to work.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.400
Blood of a close kin.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.480
There is another way.

06:57.880 --> 07:02.320
The blood of the whole clan
works the same.

07:20.400 --> 07:24.560
Zhaoyan, you finally came back.

07:40.520 --> 07:41.880
What's that face?

07:43.240 --> 07:45.840
Did you do something behind my back?

07:47.080 --> 07:50.840
No, Maiming, Miss Ming needs a favor.

07:56.200 --> 07:57.200
My master died.

07:57.920 --> 08:01.200
I heard that the Dragon Pool
can bring back the deceased.

08:01.880 --> 08:03.840
I'd like to go there through Rehai.

08:04.840 --> 08:06.000
Miss Luo, please help me.

08:10.360 --> 08:11.410
Maiming.

08:13.800 --> 08:15.960
The Dragon Pool
is stationed with a garrison.

08:16.840 --> 08:18.600
No one can enter easily.

08:21.320 --> 08:23.320
Miss Ming, you don't look so well.

08:23.320 --> 08:25.440
Why don't you rest tonight and enter

08:26.080 --> 08:27.240
the Dragon Pool tomorrow?

08:31.760 --> 08:32.780
Thank you.

08:36.120 --> 08:37.880
Your friends have settled in?

08:39.000 --> 08:40.080
Thank you, Maiming.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.679
I will see Xian Qing and others now.

08:47.400 --> 08:51.320
Zhaoyan, may I have a word with you?

09:01.320 --> 09:03.600
You told them about Rehai.

09:04.960 --> 09:08.120
It seems that you consider them
your important partners.

09:12.360 --> 09:15.320
We've been through life and death.
I trust them.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.360
I don't trust anyone,

09:21.000 --> 09:22.240
but you.

09:31.400 --> 09:35.840
What's your deal with that wolf demon?

09:41.490 --> 09:45.740
♪Twin flowers bloom on the same branch♪

09:46.280 --> 09:47.380
Zhaoyan.

09:50.000 --> 09:52.280
I know you
better than anyone in the world.

09:55.080 --> 09:56.180
You can't hide it from me.

09:57.040 --> 09:59.440
Maiming, I'm not hiding anything.

10:06.230 --> 10:07.860
♪Under the sycamore tree♪

10:08.760 --> 10:10.960
I don't know how I feel right now.

10:12.720 --> 10:15.000
I always say that I want to

10:15.600 --> 10:18.400
make the Luo family thrive
in my remaining days.

10:20.600 --> 10:21.680
But now...

10:25.800 --> 10:30.400
You only have a few years left
because I took your life.

10:33.920 --> 10:38.400
You disguise yourself
as a man to protect me.

10:40.000 --> 10:41.960
Don't you resent such fate?

10:43.760 --> 10:44.920
Don't you hate me?

10:46.360 --> 10:47.380
Maiming.

10:50.440 --> 10:52.360
My mind has never changed.

10:54.640 --> 10:57.600
I'd be lying if I say
I've never felt resentment.

10:58.840 --> 11:01.880
But since it's decided
that I can't live long,

11:02.520 --> 11:04.920
I might as well focus on
living a brilliant life.

11:06.240 --> 11:08.960
It gives me more freedom
to present myself as a man.

11:09.760 --> 11:10.960
And I've made many friends.

11:12.360 --> 11:14.760
I'm happy, Maiming. Seriously.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.440
Then...

11:23.320 --> 11:27.920
They know that you're a girl?

11:37.360 --> 11:39.160
They promised to keep it a secret.

11:44.840 --> 11:45.880
Then,

11:48.600 --> 11:50.680
I don't have to keep pretending.

11:58.880 --> 12:02.760
Zhaoyan, I have a gift for you.

12:05.880 --> 12:06.900
A gift?

14:02.040 --> 14:03.560
Appreciate orioles among flowers.

14:04.560 --> 14:05.900
Appreciate beauties under the moon.

14:06.600 --> 14:09.240
My sister is such a pretty girl.

14:13.480 --> 14:16.560
Can I change into my clothes now?

14:17.640 --> 14:19.720
I'm not really used to this.

14:19.720 --> 14:23.080
The ceremony is coming.
Our clan people are returning.

14:24.240 --> 14:25.960
It's nothing weird to see a new face.

14:26.840 --> 14:29.720
Why don't you live as a girl?

14:30.240 --> 14:34.440
Is it because you don't like my gift?

14:45.240 --> 14:46.320
Fine.

15:01.780 --> 15:04.750
(Harmonious and Auspicious)

15:19.120 --> 15:20.140
Zhaoyan.

15:45.440 --> 15:47.600
Zhaoyan, I saw you.

15:50.720 --> 15:52.040
Don't come over here yet.

16:10.640 --> 16:12.780
♪Creating ripples again♪

16:13.420 --> 16:16.560
♪That determined look on your face♪

16:17.650 --> 16:21.840
♪I sense your warmth in my palms♪

16:21.840 --> 16:26.100
♪Light and shadow freeze at the moment♪

16:26.610 --> 16:28.880
♪I look for you here and there♪

16:29.390 --> 16:33.040
♪Following the strong heartbeat♪

16:33.040 --> 16:38.000
♪Holding your hands, I breathe rapidly♪

16:38.510 --> 16:43.950
♪The answer slowly grows clear♪

16:45.300 --> 16:49.490
♪One hug is enough for an answer♪

16:50.130 --> 16:53.680
♪One look speaks for our determination♪

16:53.680 --> 16:57.810
♪What can I say to depict it♪

16:58.450 --> 17:01.230
♪Why do I only want you♪

17:01.230 --> 17:05.650
♪A smile of yours melts all my sorrow♪

17:06.190 --> 17:09.810
♪It's all worth it
as long as you're around♪

17:09.810 --> 17:14.900
♪I won't listen to any rumor♪

17:15.410 --> 17:20.300
♪I'm sure I only want you♪

17:21.140 --> 17:25.579
♪One hug is enough for an answer♪

17:25.579 --> 17:29.620
♪One look speaks for our determination♪

17:29.620 --> 17:34.160
♪What can I say to depict it♪

17:34.160 --> 17:37.390
♪Why do I only want you♪

17:37.390 --> 17:41.580
♪A smile of yours melts all my sorrow♪

17:42.130 --> 17:45.650
♪It's all worth it
as long as you're around♪

17:45.650 --> 17:50.930
♪I won't listen to any rumor♪

17:51.440 --> 17:56.240
♪I'm sure I only want you♪

18:22.240 --> 18:23.280
Zhao...

18:24.480 --> 18:25.550
Leave them alone.

18:26.720 --> 18:29.080
Zhaoyan is really a girl.

18:30.040 --> 18:31.640
Don't you know it all along?

18:32.880 --> 18:35.310
I'm just not used to it.

18:35.840 --> 18:37.800
I guess we can't call her Luo anymore.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.240
Let's call her Zhaoyan.

18:53.320 --> 18:54.320
You look amazing.

19:08.560 --> 19:10.280
Walk with me.

19:56.820 --> 19:58.550
(Chunzi)

20:03.240 --> 20:05.800
Y-You're Miss Luo.

20:06.680 --> 20:09.120
Since Zhaoyan trusts you,

20:10.320 --> 20:12.320
I don't have to hide anything.

20:13.440 --> 20:14.600
I'm Luo Maiming.

20:17.480 --> 20:20.280
"Miss Luo" became "Mr. Luo"
out of the blue.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.360
We have to get used to it.

20:27.880 --> 20:28.980
Where is Zhaoyan?

20:29.760 --> 20:30.770
She fell sick.

20:32.080 --> 20:35.680
She told us to get you into Rehai first.

20:36.300 --> 20:37.760
How is she doing?

20:37.760 --> 20:40.280
It's a chronic problem.
She just needs some rest.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.880
We know Zhaoyan.

20:42.880 --> 20:45.480
She'd come to say goodbye
even if she was sick.

20:46.920 --> 20:49.160
I persuaded her to stay and rest.

20:51.920 --> 20:53.010
What's wrong, Uncle?

21:23.360 --> 21:24.600
Xian Qing is gone?

21:25.480 --> 21:27.720
Yeah, he was right behind us.

21:29.720 --> 21:31.440
I bet he has things to deal with.

21:31.440 --> 21:32.520
Let's head to Dragon Pool first.

21:33.160 --> 21:35.440
Yeah, let's deal with the things
about Mr. Gu first

21:35.440 --> 21:38.160
and meet them later. Let's go.

22:08.680 --> 22:09.740
Zhaoyan.

22:24.000 --> 22:27.400
Maiming, what's going on?

22:27.920 --> 22:31.800
A distinguished guest visited yesterday.

22:33.640 --> 22:35.560
Guess what he told me?

22:37.360 --> 22:40.960
He told me
how to remove the Bloodbinding.

22:42.920 --> 22:43.920
Really?

22:46.760 --> 22:49.840
Back then, I thought

22:50.480 --> 22:53.360
I could sacrifice just myself.

22:54.720 --> 22:56.480
But I ended up as a prisoner forever,

22:58.160 --> 23:00.840
constantly borrowing life from others

23:01.600 --> 23:04.160
and living like a walking dead.

23:04.760 --> 23:06.960
I know, Maiming.

23:06.960 --> 23:09.480
You've been tormented all these years.

23:10.320 --> 23:11.920
There is a way out now, right?

23:13.480 --> 23:19.480
Yeah, he said only the blood
of the closest kin would work.

23:24.720 --> 23:27.200
You need my blood.

23:29.840 --> 23:33.840
Zhaoyan, do you remember

23:34.800 --> 23:37.480
that you'd live or die with me?

23:39.320 --> 23:41.520
I do. Of course.

23:43.400 --> 23:45.280
But all you have to do is ask, Maiming.

23:46.040 --> 23:47.520
Why did you chain me up?

23:47.520 --> 23:48.840
Because you've changed.

23:50.600 --> 23:52.880
There is someone else on your mind now.

23:57.240 --> 23:59.950
(Guixu Maze of Memory)

24:02.840 --> 24:03.920
What's going on?

24:06.800 --> 24:08.400
Hello, intruders.

24:10.960 --> 24:12.460
Are you the garrison of the Dragon Pool?

24:13.280 --> 24:16.280
We're with the guardian of Pureness
and we're heading to the Dragon Pool.

24:17.360 --> 24:18.450
Please let us pass.

24:20.120 --> 24:21.760
Guardian of Pureness?

24:23.160 --> 24:26.960
This guardian is so dark deep down.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.420
What...

24:30.320 --> 24:31.400
Miss Ming.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.430
Ming Xiu.

24:32.940 --> 24:34.360
Qi, hold my hand.

24:36.000 --> 24:39.640
Stay lost in the maze
of memories forever.

24:46.560 --> 24:50.160
Where is Xian Qing and others?
You didn't hurt them, right?

24:55.560 --> 24:57.800
You're still thinking about him.

24:59.600 --> 25:00.760
Where are they, Maiming?

25:01.560 --> 25:02.560
Don't hurt them, okay?

25:04.560 --> 25:07.400
I shouldn't have let you
go to the Luori Village.

25:08.560 --> 25:10.760
That wolf demon
took the chance to approach you.

25:11.800 --> 25:13.000
So you're targeting...

25:13.000 --> 25:14.060
Yeah.

25:18.120 --> 25:19.320
I'll kill the wolf demon.

25:20.480 --> 25:23.200
Are you crazy, Maiming? Are you mad?

25:23.920 --> 25:29.240
Why? You're worried
about him, aren't you?

25:29.240 --> 25:30.320
Maiming.

25:31.920 --> 25:36.360
By the end of the day,
you'll be back to normal.

26:00.840 --> 26:04.800
Xian Qing, go! He's after you!

26:04.800 --> 26:05.840
You're here.

26:08.520 --> 26:09.720
Maiming...

26:10.640 --> 26:12.360
Maiming...

26:12.880 --> 26:14.040
Go, Xian Qing!

26:23.640 --> 26:26.440
Luo Maiming,
you've always cherished Zhaoyan.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.720
And she's done a lot for you.

26:29.720 --> 26:32.840
I'm the one you want.
Why do you have to do this to her?

26:34.200 --> 26:37.080
We've been
keeping each other company for years.

26:38.160 --> 26:39.880
But now she only cares about you.

26:41.200 --> 26:43.120
In that case, I might as well kill her.

26:44.960 --> 26:47.960
You want to kill her? No way.

26:58.000 --> 26:59.840
Maiming, let him go.

26:59.840 --> 27:00.850
Xian Qing.

27:09.320 --> 27:10.760
Maiming, please.

27:28.680 --> 27:30.760
Maiming, please let him go.

27:30.760 --> 27:32.120
Please don't hurt him.

27:32.120 --> 27:33.140
Xian Qing.

27:34.840 --> 27:36.600
I-I'm here.

27:37.880 --> 27:38.930
Xian Qing.

27:44.080 --> 27:47.520
Wolf demon,
if I apply a bit more pressure,

27:48.480 --> 27:50.560
your life would be at risk.

27:52.920 --> 27:53.940
Try again.

27:57.400 --> 28:02.080
Xian Qing...

28:03.840 --> 28:04.850
Xian Qing.

28:12.720 --> 28:17.680
Mother, Uncle killed the demon.

28:17.680 --> 28:19.520
We're safe now.

28:19.520 --> 28:23.360
It's supposed to be your birthday.

28:24.280 --> 28:26.520
- I don't want to celebrate it.
- What a pity.

28:26.520 --> 28:28.200
I only want you.

28:35.200 --> 28:36.240
Mother.

28:48.880 --> 28:52.600
Mother...

28:54.160 --> 28:55.440
Mother.

28:57.080 --> 29:01.000
Mother, wake up.

29:01.560 --> 29:04.720
Wake up, Mother.

29:05.520 --> 29:09.200
Is that Miss Ming's memory?

29:15.640 --> 29:19.120
Judging from what the garrison said,

29:20.240 --> 29:23.600
we should find the way out of here
through your memory.

29:24.960 --> 29:30.480
Miss Ming, what happened after that?

29:33.960 --> 29:36.840
Ming Xiu, it doesn't help
to avoid the past.

29:43.160 --> 29:46.720
Miss Ming, I don't know
what happened back then,

29:47.600 --> 29:49.800
but you got adopted by Mr. Gu.

29:50.320 --> 29:51.410
So your family...

29:52.880 --> 29:56.640
What has happened doesn't fade away
even if you choose to avoid it.

29:56.640 --> 29:57.680
Shut up.

30:04.760 --> 30:09.720
Miss Ming, when I was hiding in my room,

30:10.320 --> 30:13.200
Mr. Gu told me
to face everything with courage.

30:14.360 --> 30:17.080
I think that's what he'd say to you.

30:26.320 --> 30:27.520
Mother.

30:29.720 --> 30:33.000
Mother...

30:35.440 --> 30:38.040
Why didn't you tell me you were hurt?

30:45.000 --> 30:46.000
Mother.

30:48.600 --> 30:49.880
Mother.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.640
Mother.

30:57.280 --> 30:58.320
Mother.

31:01.120 --> 31:02.130
Master.

31:07.000 --> 31:11.120
Now I see why Ming Xiu
hates demons so much.

31:12.760 --> 31:16.440
That's why you never
celebrate your birthday.

31:18.440 --> 31:22.600
Garrison, we shouldn't have
barged into the hole of spring.

31:23.520 --> 31:24.560
But we have no choice.

31:26.440 --> 31:29.560
Please stop your malicious trick.

31:33.280 --> 31:36.320
This scene is from her memory.

31:37.000 --> 31:39.760
I simply restored it.

31:39.760 --> 31:41.440
There are all kinds of memories.

31:41.440 --> 31:43.760
Ming Xiu had so many
nice memories with Mr. Gu.

31:43.760 --> 31:44.760
Why didn't you show that?

31:45.320 --> 31:48.680
You're just a monster
who spies on people's secrets.

31:51.520 --> 31:52.590
Xiu.

31:54.560 --> 31:56.480
You dreamed about your mother again?

31:59.240 --> 32:03.600
Is there any spell
to bring her back, Master?

32:12.000 --> 32:14.160
The best comfort for the deceased

32:14.160 --> 32:16.000
is to live well.

32:17.640 --> 32:20.680
As long as the living inherit
the wishes and beliefs of the deceased,

32:20.680 --> 32:22.610
the deceased are in a sense resurrected,

32:23.700 --> 32:25.070
having their lives continued.

32:42.360 --> 32:43.400
What happened?

32:49.640 --> 32:50.740
Where are we now?

32:52.280 --> 32:53.360
Ming Xiu is gone.

33:00.200 --> 33:02.360
W-What on earth is that?

33:03.160 --> 33:04.360
So ugly.

33:04.360 --> 33:06.880
Joys, sorrows, fury, and pleasures.

33:07.640 --> 33:10.000
I appear in the shape of human memories.

33:10.000 --> 33:13.440
How I look represents people's minds.

33:13.440 --> 33:15.480
That's enough. Where is Miss Ming?

33:16.160 --> 33:19.840
The guardian of Pureness is too obsessed

33:20.400 --> 33:22.440
to leave the maze of memories.

33:23.280 --> 33:24.720
Let Ming Xiu out.

33:26.520 --> 33:28.800
If she remains immersed in it,

33:28.800 --> 33:30.560
no one can get her out.

33:41.920 --> 33:43.520
Xian Qing...

33:46.520 --> 33:47.920
Xian Qing...

33:50.280 --> 33:51.720
So naive.

33:52.680 --> 33:56.600
I can crush you easily right now.

33:56.600 --> 33:57.970
You want to save her?

33:58.900 --> 34:01.800
There is another way.
Would you like to try it?

34:05.320 --> 34:10.030
I heard that the demons
can't live without their demonic orbs,

34:10.600 --> 34:13.440
which contain all their energy.

34:14.480 --> 34:16.080
I'm very curious.

34:17.600 --> 34:20.679
Why don't you show me your orb?

34:21.199 --> 34:22.639
Maiming...

34:22.639 --> 34:24.560
Xian Qing, no!

34:27.320 --> 34:28.370
No.

34:34.920 --> 34:40.960
The person who sets up the game
is asking the pawn to make a choice?

34:47.440 --> 34:50.880
The demonic orb and the demonic power

34:52.440 --> 34:53.840
mean nothing to me.

34:56.159 --> 35:00.080
If you want them, have them.

35:07.120 --> 35:08.640
Xian Qing...

35:10.280 --> 35:13.040
My life is worth it when I have someone

35:16.760 --> 35:17.780
to die for.

35:19.200 --> 35:20.480
No, Xian Qing.

36:14.840 --> 36:17.400
I heard that demons die
very soon after they're depleted

36:18.640 --> 36:20.840
of their demonic orbs.

36:31.760 --> 36:33.360
Xian Qing...

36:38.480 --> 36:39.760
Maiming...

36:40.320 --> 36:42.800
Xian Qing...

36:48.880 --> 36:51.400
Xian Qing...

36:54.960 --> 36:56.440
Maiming...

36:56.440 --> 36:59.400
The removal of Bloodbinding
is between you and me.

36:59.400 --> 37:02.400
Are you planning to give up your life?

37:02.920 --> 37:05.280
You want my life? Take it.

37:05.280 --> 37:06.720
Why involve someone innocent?

37:07.680 --> 37:09.560
Did you make this decision

37:11.000 --> 37:14.720
because of me or the wolf demon?

37:16.400 --> 37:18.700
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

37:18.700 --> 37:22.610
♪They symbolize my love♪

37:22.610 --> 37:25.840
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

37:26.680 --> 37:30.120
Maiming, even if it's not Xian Qing,

37:30.960 --> 37:34.360
even if it's Yue, Miss Yue,
or our disciples here,

37:34.360 --> 37:35.720
I'd do my best to protect them.

37:38.480 --> 37:43.360
I'm the only one
you're willing to abandon.

37:47.560 --> 37:50.480
Maiming, I've never
meant to break my promise

37:53.000 --> 37:54.200
as long as you don't hurt anyone.

37:55.880 --> 37:58.480
Don't you want freedom? Let me help.

37:59.680 --> 38:02.320
Please don't hurt Xian Qing, okay?

38:05.120 --> 38:08.840
As long as you want it,
I will be like I used to be.

38:12.200 --> 38:13.300
Maiming.

38:14.640 --> 38:19.240
Are you trying to trade your life
for the wolf demon's life?

38:22.720 --> 38:25.480
It's not a trade. Maiming.

38:26.400 --> 38:28.080
Don't make more mistakes.

38:32.240 --> 38:35.080
Maiming, as long as you want it,

38:37.040 --> 38:38.560
I will be like I used to be.

38:42.720 --> 38:46.920
I will protect you
like I used to, Maiming.

38:47.640 --> 38:49.390
♪And I was lost in your charm♪

38:50.770 --> 38:53.490
♪I gave up everything just for you♪

38:54.200 --> 38:55.280
Maiming.

38:57.300 --> 38:59.630
♪If love arises with the wind♪

38:59.630 --> 39:03.250
♪How do I calm it♪

39:03.880 --> 39:04.940
Maiming.

39:07.200 --> 39:08.760
Xian Qing...

39:11.680 --> 39:12.720
Xian Qing.

39:13.300 --> 39:16.150
♪They symbolize my love♪

39:16.660 --> 39:22.060
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

39:22.060 --> 39:24.620
♪If love arises with the wind♪

39:26.080 --> 39:28.240
Xian Qing...

39:29.010 --> 39:31.120
♪I've given it my all♪

39:31.120 --> 39:33.900
♪But our paths just don't cross♪

39:34.600 --> 39:35.630
Maiming.

39:36.160 --> 39:37.230
Leave.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.430
Maiming.

39:41.360 --> 39:43.040
Go back to your friends.

39:44.080 --> 39:45.800
Never come back to the Luo family.

39:48.000 --> 39:49.010
Maiming.

39:52.480 --> 39:53.550
Get lost.

40:45.520 --> 40:49.040
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

40:50.550 --> 40:53.840
♪Burns what once was♪

40:54.610 --> 40:57.460
♪The name is forgotten♪

41:01.560 --> 41:05.360
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

41:06.580 --> 41:09.490
♪Only through the eyes♪

41:10.320 --> 41:13.870
♪Who can see them clearly♪

41:15.510 --> 41:22.160
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

41:23.380 --> 41:30.220
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

41:31.570 --> 41:39.500
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

41:39.500 --> 41:46.480
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

42:03.510 --> 42:07.500
♪The seemingly random paths♪

42:08.560 --> 42:12.050
♪The burning traces♪

42:12.560 --> 42:16.850
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

42:19.440 --> 42:23.890
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

42:24.600 --> 42:27.920
♪Are all carefully♪

42:28.530 --> 42:32.590
♪Arranged by me♪

42:33.560 --> 42:40.910
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

42:41.490 --> 42:48.500
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

42:48.500 --> 42:57.490
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

42:57.490 --> 43:04.750
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

43:05.520 --> 43:12.940
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

43:13.520 --> 43:20.910
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

43:21.580 --> 43:29.100
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

43:29.650 --> 43:39.180
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
